{"c":[{"id":"15d4fcad6f30cb62","sum":"SnippetLedger over model.windows.values() charges a taken text to every window showing it, either way round, and refuses if any is over budget; a kindless fill field is withheld only on cuts of typed values or its label words, never on any cut (B13).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261003T075125Z-769f076b2b26d50b","text":"SnippetLedger(windows) charges a taken text to every window that shows it, either way round (line inside the text, or text inside a line); refuses when any of them is over budget. Build it over model.windows.values(), never just the source window (B13).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261003T075154Z-10f895f4b8d309e7","text":"A fill field whose label names no kind is withheld when a cut took a typed value or a cut conversation left out a line sharing its label words; withholding it on any cut blanked Name on the fill desk (unrelated team chat always cut) and lost the first-look offer (B13 live-final).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"be073912f9f26071","sum":"Live Jev replays vary by about 3 fields run to run (24-27 of 78, B13): rerun before reading a delta. Socket tests bind publish/sendToReader to the HelperServer made in that beforeEach, or a late 'stopped' leaks into the next test (B14).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261003T075211Z-5ac7a437648ff4d5","text":"Live replay noise: the same code gave 24, 26, 27 and 25 of 78 on 'sources in Messages' rule on (B13); pre-ask withholding is deterministic, so differences under about 3 fields are Jev answering differently. Rerun part with --variants/--rules/--fixes before reading a delta.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261003T100918Z-34fd442f4a978ffa","text":"Socket test harnesses must bind the helper's publish/sendToReader to the HelperServer made in that beforeEach, not the reassigned server variable: an earlier test's run timed out 5 s later and its 'stopped id-1' reached a later test's host (B13's flake, fixed B14).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
